      "factId": "backpack-draft-001",
      "topicId": "backpack",
      "factText": "背带内部的弹性芯材可做成外侧更厚、内侧更薄；负重后较厚部分被压缩，使整条背带更均匀贴肩并分散局部压力。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-backpack-pressure-spreading-strap"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "backpack-draft-002",
      "topicId": "backpack",
      "factText": "胸带把左右肩带横向连在一起，限制它们向外分开；这样能让背包更贴近躯干，并减少行走时向后滑动。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-backpack-sternum-strap"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "backpack-draft-003",
